# ACTION: TargetAirdrop
# Orchestrates the long-running process of aligning the fixed-wing 
# UAV and executing a precision payload drop based on vision data.

# Goal
# The final, locked WGS84 coordinate of the target. This is sent 
# only after the vision node has gathered enough frames (e.g., 75) 
# to confidently overcome camera jitter and wind disturbances.

interfaces/TargetEstimate gps_estimation

---

# Result
# The final outcome of the mission. This is triggered only once, 
# after the aircraft has passed the computed release point and 
# fired the payload servo (or if the mission is forcibly aborted).

bool drop_successful

---

# Feedback
# Continuous telemetry streamed at a fixed rate (e.g., 10Hz) while 
# the UAV flies the Dubins path. This allows the system to monitor 
# which flight phase is active (Transit, Loiter, Final Approach) 
# and track the remaining distance to the release point.

interfaces/AirdropStatus current_status